src/oracles/Curve2TokenOracle.sol:_lpTokenValue:73|C15|High|An unprivileged attacker flashloans Curve LP, calls remove_liquidity on an ETH-holding 2-token pool, and from the ETH-transfer callback (where self.balances[0] is already decremented but balances[1] and totalSupply are not yet burned) triggers a vault liquidation that reads this oracle, which reports the LP 5–15% below fair value while the get_dy deviation band stays satisfied because stableswap price is flat near balance, letting the attacker seize healthy positions' collateral at the liquidation discount before completing the withdrawal.|src/oracles/Curve2TokenOracle.sol
